      "html_url": "https://github.com/md-riaz/Flutter-DomainPulse",
      "description": "DomainPulse tracks expiry with alarm-based background checks. UI manages domains, nty.sh one-time topic setup, interval suggestions (15m/1h/6h/1d/custom). App triggers push when expiry is 1h away or past, using accurate parsed expiry datetime. Home includes Play Store install button and GitHub Releases APK link named with pubspec version.",
